          <th scope="row">Delta Lake</th>
          <td>The <code>MERGE ... ON</code> predicate</td>
          <td>Whatever the source side of the <code>MERGE</code> holds; several matching source rows can fail the merge. Ties are yours to define.</td>
          <td>Your own guard in the <code>MERGE</code>, plus one row per key in the source</td>
